<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.Section>普通剧本默认剧情配置</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.Section>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.Description>新建普通游戏会静默使用以下配置。修改仅影响之后创建的新游戏，不影响已有存档；普通派系关系不提供逐派系“自定义”模式。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.Description>

  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.OrdinaryFaction.Subsection>普通派系</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.OrdinaryFaction.Subsection>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.OrdinaryFactionRelations.Label>普通派系关系</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.OrdinaryFactionRelations.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.OrdinaryFactionRelations.Description>决定普通新存档与所有普通派系的初始关系模式。此处不提供需要绑定具体世界派系实例的逐派系“自定义”模式。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.OrdinaryFactionRelations.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.FactionOutpost.Label>普通派系前哨生成频率</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.FactionOutpost.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.FactionOutpost.Description>决定普通新存档中普通派系前哨的自然生成频率。默认值为“频率：低”；创建存档后该值会保存进存档，不再跟随此设置变化。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.FactionOutpost.Description>

  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.HostileFactions.Subsection>机械巢与虫巢</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.HostileFactions.Subsection>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.MechHiveRelation.Label>与机械巢关系</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.MechHiveRelation.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.MechHiveRelation.Description>决定普通新存档与机械巢的初始关系模式。若实际世界中不存在机械巢，创建新游戏时会自动恢复为默认关系。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.MechHiveRelation.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.MechHiveNode.Label>机械巢节点生成频率</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.MechHiveNode.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.MechHiveNode.Description>决定普通新存档中机械巢节点的自然生成频率。默认值为“频率：低”；创建存档后该值会保存进存档，不再跟随此设置变化。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.MechHiveNode.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.InsectRelation.Label>与虫巢关系</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.InsectRelation.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.InsectRelation.Description>决定普通新存档与虫巢派系的初始关系模式。若实际世界中不存在虫族派系，创建新游戏时会自动恢复为默认关系。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.InsectRelation.Description>

  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.Routes.Subsection>剧情路线</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.Routes.Subsection>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.PurgeDirective.Label>肃清指令</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.PurgeDirective.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.PurgeDirective.Description>决定普通新存档是否启用肃清指令路线。肃清指令与共生盟约互斥。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.PurgeDirective.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.PurgeDirective.DisabledReason>只有将机械巢关系设为“盟友”后才能启用肃清指令。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.PurgeDirective.DisabledReason>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.SymbiosisCovenant.Label>共生盟约</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.SymbiosisCovenant.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.SymbiosisCovenant.Description>决定普通新存档是否启用共生盟约路线。共生盟约与肃清指令互斥。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.SymbiosisCovenant.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.SymbiosisCovenant.DisabledReason>当前普通派系关系被永久锁定，不满足共生盟约的启用条件。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.SymbiosisCovenant.DisabledReason>

  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.Ideology.Subsection>文化适配</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.Ideology.Subsection>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.IdeologyAdaptation.Label>文化适配程度</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.IdeologyAdaptation.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.IdeologyAdaptation.Description>决定普通新存档中机械族机械师使用的文化适配等级。默认值为“全部启用”。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.IdeologyAdaptation.Description>
</LanguageData>
